# Stage 19 — Retrospective

Write `retrospective/retrospective.md`: what went well, recurring problems,
defect families encountered, and decisions worth reusing. Write
`retrospective/template_update_suggestions.md`: concrete improvements for the
reference docs / skills / prompts (so future books benefit).

If any reusable translation-quality defect family was found during this book,
record a concrete proposed skill change in
`retrospective/template_update_suggestions.md`; do not mutate shared skills.
Otherwise record `NOT_APPLICABLE` with a reason.

Exit condition: both retrospective files exist. Stop for controller validation;
only the controller may complete the run.
